   - COMPACTNESS / DISTANCE_CIRCULARITY: Relates overall shape compactness to border distance utilization.
   - PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO / MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO: Highlights symmetry or elongation differences via axis proportions.
   - SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION / ELONGATEDNESS: Combines mass distribution and elongation properties.
