6. ELONGATEDNESS: Relates the area to the square of shrink width, indicating elongation.
7. SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION: Reflects the overall spread of mass around the axes.
8. SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS: Captures asymmetry along the major axis.
9. SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS: Captures asymmetry along the minor axis.
10. KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS: Highlights the peakedness of distribution along the minor axis.
11. KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS: Highlights the peakedness of distribution along the major axis.

